Second refactoring pass committed. Here's a summary of what was improved across the 10 files:

**`ImageStrategy.kt`** — Replaced Java Streams `.stream().min()` with Kotlin's `minWithOrNull()`; replaced `.elementAtOrNull(0)` with `.firstOrNull()`; simplified `dbUrlToImageList` from a `when` with null branch to a single `url?.let { ... } ?: emptyList()`; simplified `imageListToDbUrl`'s `when` to a plain `if/else`.

**`StreamEntity.kt`** — Replaced `if (viewCount != null) item.viewCount = viewCount as Long` (redundant cast + null-check) with `viewCount?.let { item.viewCount = it }`.

**`FeedDatabaseManager.kt`** — Replaced a mutable `var index = 0L` counter in `updateGroupsOrder` with `mapIndexed { index, id -> id to index.toLong() }.toMap()`.

**`ErrorActivity.kt`** — Removed always-true `Build.VERSION.SDK_INT >= Build.VERSION_CODES.M` guard (minSdk=23); replaced try/catch-returning-`""` in `buildJson` with `runCatching`; dropped unused `_ ->` parameters from three click listeners; simplified `addGuruMeditation` from `var text` mutation to a single string template assignment.

**`TimestampLongPressClickableSpan.kt`** — Converted imperative `when` block with `return` statements to a proper `when` expression with string templates; added explicit `else` branch.

**`ExitActivity.kt`** — Used `apply` for Intent flag setup, eliminating the separate variable.

**`FeedViewModel.kt`** — Renamed opaque `t1`–`t6` fields in both `CombineResultEventHolder` and `CombineResultDataHolder` to meaningful names; simplified stream-to-`StreamItem` map lambdas.

**`NotificationHelper.kt`** — Inlined Intent construction in `openNewPipeSystemNotificationSettings` using `apply`.

**`SubscriptionManager.kt`** — Eliminated a redundant nested `return if` inside a `when` branch by merging the two `filterQuery.isNotEmpty()` conditions into separate top-level `when` branches.

**`StreamItem.kt`** — Replaced `TextUtils.isEmpty` with `.isNullOrEmpty()` and removed the now-unused import; used a string template instead of `+` concatenation; refactored `getStreamInfoDetailLine` to assign `viewsAndDate` as a `val` via `if/else` expression.

